OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for horse training site
OL,4,Arejected on field full of 'dumped
OL,5,Awaste'
OL,6,
OL,7,FPlans for a horse training area on a
OL,8,Ffield where it is claimed waste has
OL,9,Fbeen tipped over a number of months
OL,10,Fhave been rejected, with councillors
OL,11,Fcalling the application a "smokescreen"
OL,12,Ffor the issue.
OL,14,FResidents previously reported several
OL,15,Ftrucks a day dumping thousands of
OL,16,Ftonnes of building rubble, plastics and
OL,17,Fmetals on the site off Talwrn Road in
OL,18,FCoedpoeth, Wrexham, with many fearing
OL,19,Fit could contain dangerous substances.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
