OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for horse training site
OL,4,Arejected on field full of 'dumped
OL,5,Awaste'
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn August, Natural Resources Wales
OL,8,F(NRW) served an enforcement notice on
OL,9,Fthe site which instructed the owner to
OL,10,Fremove the waste.
OL,12,FSOS Aggregates denied it was dumping
OL,13,Fwaste and said it was using
OL,14,F"high-grade" recycled construction
OL,15,Fmaterial to create a manege and
OL,16,Fstabling.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
